A track is one sequential line of work, so steps within it do not overlap; simultaneous work belongs on separate tracks. Each step has exactly one duration form: fixed, variable, or indefinite. A start trigger connects a step to the program clock, an offset, another step, a manual action, an abort, or a compound condition. Step IDs must be unique across the entire program, and every task used by a step must have a matching resource constraint whose `maxConcurrent` limits simultaneous use. Repeated work is represented once with `replicates`, not by copying steps or tracks; per-instance continuations use `instances: "each"`, barriers use `instances: "all"`, and `maxInFlight` limits work held between those stages. This protocol has one operator, with one cabinet, water bath, centrifuge, and microscope; the incubator must accommodate the four newly seeded flasks overnight, while the cabinet is limited to one open flask at a time.

Expected resource constraints:

- `biosafety_cabinet`: `maxConcurrent` 1
- `water_bath`: `maxConcurrent` 1
- `co2_incubator`: `maxConcurrent` 4
- `centrifuge`: `maxConcurrent` 1
- `microscope`: `maxConcurrent` 1
- `operator`: `maxConcurrent` 1

```json
{
  "acknowledgement": "A track is a sequential line of work; each step has one duration kind; start triggers link steps to the clock or dependencies; stepIds are globally unique; every task needs a matching resourceConstraint; repeated work uses replicates with each/all instance relationships and optional maxInFlight; this protocol has one operator and shared equipment, with one open flask at a time in the biosafety cabinet.",
  "resourceConstraints": [
    {
      "task": "biosafety_cabinet",
      "maxConcurrent": 1
    },
    {
      "task": "water_bath",
      "maxConcurrent": 1
    },
    {
      "task": "co2_incubator",
      "maxConcurrent": 4
    },
    {
      "task": "centrifuge",
      "maxConcurrent": 1
    },
    {
      "task": "microscope",
      "maxConcurrent": 1
    },
    {
      "task": "operator",
      "maxConcurrent": 1
    }
  ],
  "actors": 1
}
```
